There will be occasions when progress feels slow. There will be meetings that seem to achieve very little, plans that need to be rewritten, and days when the easiest thing would be to walk away.
On those days, remember the work that has already been done. Remember the people who are depending on us to finish what we started. Then choose the next practical step.
